  "answer": "Gold members enjoy the following benefits: priority check-in, priority boarding, priority baggage handling, one additional 27 kg checked bag, lounge access for the member plus one guest on medium- and long-haul departures, free standard seat selection, and 50% bonus points on flights. Points also do not expire while the member holds Gold status. Additionally, award tickets can be redeemed in points, with taxes and charges paid in cash, and there are specific rules for changing or cancelling award tickets. If an award ticket is cancelled more than 24 hours before departure, the points are redeposited for a fee of EUR 30 and the taxes are refunded. If it is cancelled within 24 hours of departure or not used, the points are forfeited and only the taxes are refunded. Changing an award ticket costs EUR 25.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
}
